The complete process works as follows:

YouTube Channel URL  
↓  
YouTube Data API  
↓  
Channel Data Collection  
↓  
Feature Engineering  
↓  
Log Transformation  
↓  
Feature Scaling  
↓  
Autoencoder Model  
↓  
Reconstruction Error  
↓  
Threshold Comparison  
↓  
Final Result

The result page displays the channel information along with the metrics used by the AI model and the final prediction.

